patch emote-commands
made-for KMS2 KR Live client Data/Xml.m2d
# Typed emote commands (/bow, /greet): the chat box matches the keywords of string/<language>/kordynamicaction.xml,
# and the Korean table has Korean keywords only. Each emote row keeps them and adds the English keywords of the
# same emote from the pack's English table, so both work.
